{
  "title": "Sphinx",
  "about": "The Sphinx face on as a bust, centred for a triangle surface, for the Dinki Dell doof: the headdress flaring out to the shoulders like a pyramid, striped gold and blue, the cobra on the brow, the false beard and a broad striped collar, with a sun behind its head. A ripple of light runs down the stripes on the beat and the eyes look round and blink; through a build the eyes glow red, and on the drop they blaze with laser starbursts.",
